  "description": "If you feel like you are guessing...step out of the way!",
  "body_html": "<p>This is my 18th year of investing, 5 publicly as a creator. A small group of unread trolls will often blurt in the comments: “Time in the market is better than timing the market.” Then…they go silent as they get steamrolled when the market takes a dump. <em><strong>None of the best investors, are in the market every single day.</strong></em> Not a single investor from Unknown Wizards<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a> or my personal favorite, Mark Minervini, two-time U.S. Investing Champion and author of “Trade Like a Stock Market Wizard”<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-2\" href=\"#footnote-2\" target=\"_self\">2</a> sit in the market when everything is going against them. It just frankly sounds stupid. If you want to hold bags of ass and achieve mediocre results, help yourself. There are tons of Finance Substack pages aiming for just that, and you will find a warm home with them. Its not here! </p><p>One common trait amongst ALL of the best traders and investors in those books, is:</p><ol><li><p>They are not in the market everyday. Of course you need to give positions time to “cook” per your strategy…but it is not an everyday game. </p></li><li><p>They admit when their strategy is not working, or they do not have high confidence in the market, either direction. They step to the side. </p></li></ol><p>That is where I am at right now…I simply do not have a firm idea of where the market is going, in regards to a trend, next. <em><strong>My speculation is that the markets will start to go parabolic when and if the government shutdown occurs.</strong></em> But speculations are taken with a grain of salt…the market is always right… you and I are not. </p><p>Lets see where VIX breaks to, or where the S&amp;P 500 decides to make a statement at. Then we can act. </p><p>Also….regardless of whether we go up or down…now is the time to be preparing for the bear market, whenever it comes. While newbies are circle jerking the Quantum Computing stocks we just dumped on them, you are getting smarter. Research your brokerage and google things like:</p><ul><li><p>“How to short on (insert your brokerage)”</p></li><li><p>“What is a margin account?” (know this and avoid high leverage trades)</p></li><li><p>“How do I set a stop on a short position on (insert your brokerage)?”</p></li></ul><p>As a crude example, out of roughly 5000 stocks, it will be much easier to ride the wave of the 4950 that are trending down, instead of trying to find the 50 that are going up. Again, rough statement. It will make the bear market….BEARABLE! BAHAHHAA</p><p>Keep an eye out on the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Summary</a> page, so you can see if I trimmed or sold any positions, and check out the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-market-warning-signal?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Market Warning Signal</a> from yesterday. </p><p>The main point of this video and article, is to talk about it being OK to not have a good idea everyday. It is ok to step to the side. Do not erase nearly a year’s worth of gains, by starting to guess, or fight trends. As always, I will keep you updated. I am sure price action will reveal its intentions soon! Have a great Tuesday and thanks for stopping by! </p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok?utm_source=user-menu\">StockTok Main Page</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Positions</a> |</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Resources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><p></p><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-1\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-1\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">1</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/unknown-market-wizards-jack-d-schwager/1137234681?ean=9781804090527</p></div></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-2\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-2\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">2</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/trade-like-a-stock-market-wizard-mark-minervini/1112151361?ean=9780071807227</p><p></p></div></div>",
